{"id":"ruso","lemma":"ruso","pos":"adj","rank":1922,"glosses":["Russian"],"ipa":"/ˈruso/","forms":{"feminine":"rusa","masculinePlural":"rusos","femininePlural":"rusas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-ruso.wav","formAudio":{"rusa":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-rusa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Él también puede hablar ruso.","en":"He can also speak Russian."},{"text":"Tom montó la montaña rusa.","en":"Tom rode the roller coaster."},{"text":"Más y más soldados rusos perdieron la esperanza.","en":"More and more Russian soldiers lost hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733586"},{"text":"Las montañas rusas dan miedo.","en":"Roller coasters are scary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915898"},{"text":"Él dominó rápidamente el ruso.","en":"He acquired Russian quickly."}]}